  "body": "From [www-style discussion](https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/www-style/2016Mar/0118.html): when `Element.focus()` is used the UA may scroll the element into view (it's not immediately obvious to me if this is specified or not).  In that case, there's currently no way to request the scrolling to be [smooth](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#scrolling).  Perhaps `focus` should take an optional [ScrollBehavior](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#enumdef-scrollbehavior) like [Element.scrollIntoView](https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#dom-element-scrollintoview) now does?\n",
